        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Lynn\n- Organizations: DS Virgin Racing, Virgin Group, G-Drive Racing\n- Roles: reserve driver, full-time driver\n- Events: 2017 FIA World Endurance Championship\n- Topics: Formula E, motor racing\n\nFacts:\n- Alex Lynn was born on 17 September 1993.\n- Alex Lynn is a British racing driver.\n- In 2017, Alex Lynn was the full-time driver for G-Drive Racing in the FIA World Endurance Championship.\n- Alex Lynn was the reserve driver for DS Virgin Racing in Formula E.\n- DS Virgin Racing is a British motor racing team.\n- DS Virgin Racing competes in Formula E, an electric racing series.\n- Virgin Group owns DS Virgin Racing.",
